# Core hours

The core working hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026[[cite:obs-7a88f10e674c61367a6fc21bf74b1197437baf5f "Core hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026."]].

Where the board resolution of 15 September 2026 and the staff handbook differ, the resolution applies[[cite:obs-7a88f10e674c61367a6fc21bf74b1197437baf5f "Core hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026."]][[cite:obs-f9757bf8baa5c4a56810adcbda83d5070d3b3b50 "Core hours are from 10:00 to 16:00 on working days."]].

The staff handbook states core hours as from 10:00 to 16:00 on working days[[cite:obs-f9757bf8baa5c4a56810adcbda83d5070d3b3b50 "Core hours are from 10:00 to 16:00 on working days."]].

However, the board resolution takes precedence over the staff handbook in case of any differences[[cite:obs-7a88f10e674c61367a6fc21bf74b1197437baf5f "Core hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026."]].
